{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "5a581678a05022902ce7c54dc59cdef029919aab265eeaf9e1ca329b9e872797", "ja": "～みんなと一緒～", "zh": "～和大家一起～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "20fbf24639a27559683347b5e3fb28142d987dbd93292094ce17cd5b20a7beef", "ja": "ついに記念公演の本番が始まる。不安になる\nエミリー、風花、ジュリア。3人は春香の\nお陰で少し落ち着くが、そんな春香も、実は\n緊張していることに気づく。でもみんなと\n一緒だから大丈夫と、春香は思いを伝えた。", "zh": "终于，纪念公演正式开始了。大家都感到不安。  \n艾米莉、风花和茱莉亚。3人因为春香的  \n帮助稍微冷静了一些，却发现原来春香其实也  \n很紧张。但春香传达了自己的想法：只要和大家  \n在一起，就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "c2688ffc2eb841ba20191fa33a1feba15b5ee1946be60677a746d6c2f0d45d4b", "ja": "ついに本番なのですね。大勢のごヒイキ様がこの会場\nに……。きちんと成し遂げることができるでしょうか？", "zh": "终于要正式登台了。会场里来了这么多支持我们的人……我们真的能顺利完成吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f57f7c27b021bdb88516073648a932069a3b8784df42ec4416077b1243d75b7", "ja": "そうね。立派なステージができてすごく嬉しいけど、\nこれにふさわしいライブにしなきゃって考えたら……。", "zh": "是啊。能搭建出这么棒的舞台，我真的很开心，可一想到必须举办一场与它相称的演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "4af2adc5b1b9515d2f5ffd3e35ad0f3cc73aa29c5a5dfe7fb674f4b5259e7e19", "ja": "ふたりとも不安なんだな。まあ、特別な公演を\nこんなステージでやるんだから、当然だよな。", "zh": "你们两个都很不安啊。毕竟要在这样的舞台上举办特别公演，会这样也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "68025c6fa444ae53a9c041141f976997747b8c627d6d8305313fb4e04e76c03c", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんはいつも堂々としてるね。\nうらやましいな。", "zh": "茱莉亚总是那么落落大方呢。\n真让人羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "64ef99c82f2e23ca73c55f4bebcca07cd96fa7794ad96cd9d4f047db00e0f0e7", "ja": "ははっ。そう見せてるだけだよ。\nあたしだって、緊張で体の芯が震えてる。", "zh": "哈哈，只是装得很镇定而已。\n其实我也紧张得浑身发抖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "40324ee3a6bdc09f0225a267aadba4f58b1ddb179a1a7be77eafc04292983c8e", "ja": "えへへっ。そういう時はね……\nはいっ、ジュリアちゃん、握手！", "zh": "嘿嘿。这种时候呢……\n来，茱莉亚，握手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "f0d191ccd165b6e6c89971394c167a7c48ea16cb1db07cf8bef855de8596ca57", "ja": "え？　どうしたんだ、いきなり……。あ、でもなんか、\nこうしてると安心するな……。サンキュー、ハル！", "zh": "诶？怎么了，突然来这一出……啊，不过，总觉得这样牵着手就安心多了……谢啦，小春！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "ec0e11cd10783fbd1e74560e5694657602fd3ad8c2ad58da3c05c5fa358aeecc", "ja": "どういたしまして。\nそれじゃあ、エミリーちゃんと風花さんも。", "zh": "不客气。\n那么，艾米莉和风花也一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "6346eeac87777bdbd1d2ceea16ea8bc9da037e19fae16ff2aa68f9a14d4953bc", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。\n……少し落ち着いたかも……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……。\n……好像稍微平静一点了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "05b282d08fdae93c0e461dfc7212a098309982f3683daa27b3c4f313fe0b591b", "ja": "ありがとう。……あれ、春香ちゃんも手が震えて……？\nそっか、そうなんだ……。", "zh": "谢谢你。……咦，春香的手也在抖……？\n这样啊，原来是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "faae89ba9eec0e83714457455553d1687cb4d5dbb0a65336f05d45b8d9458ece", "ja": "はい、私もすっごく緊張してて……。でもみんなと一緒\nだから大丈夫です。みんな、本番、頑張りましょう！！", "zh": "是的，我也特别紧张……不过因为和大家在一起，所以没问题。大家，正式演出时一起加油吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6a3c2ff1af129936126730564b9dca02dbad12d0637a899263aed979e2875b2", "ja": "みんなー！　私達のステージにようこそ！\n定期的に水分をとって、安全に楽しみましょうね！", "zh": "大家——！欢迎来到我们的舞台！\n请记得定期补充水分，平平安安地享受演出哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "a84ffb2666d1d2b9378b80b0f02cdfa4552ceee0819d4422bd9cf740456973a7", "ja": "みなさまのお力添え、いつもありがとうございます！\n私達の感謝の気持ちを、この舞台でお届けいたします！", "zh": "非常感谢大家一直以来的鼎力相助！\n我们满怀的感激之情，将在这方舞台上呈现给各位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "37f8dfc5f51de6f64dddac8cae5cfd56ca9751a5764831983545ca1ce381804e", "ja": "今日はウチらの集大成だ！　魂をさらけ出す\nつもりでいくからな！　みんな、ついてこいよっ！！", "zh": "今天就是我们的集大成之作！我们会拿出彻底展现灵魂的气势上场！大家，跟紧了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "0ae87c554cbc80fa1b9e530c193a9926bfec47d4a76c2ab436099ca29b4048bb", "ja": "力を合わせて、最高のステージにするからねー！\nそれじゃ、楽しんで行くよーーーっ！！", "zh": "我们齐心协力，一定会把它变成最棒的舞台——！\n那么，大家尽情享受吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0192_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0192_story_13_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "d4a24de7732f4fc96422562f5cbf6af59494bc5a2eff23580ef50ef09e85feb2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
